000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TUSERPRT.
000400 AUTHOR.        JEFF BUNGO.
000500*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR.
000600 DATE-WRITTEN.  DECEMBER 1993.
000700 DATE-COMPILED.
000800*REMARKS.
000900*
001000*D   INQUIRY AND ENTRY PROGRAM FOR PRINT FILE.
      *    THIS PROGRAM WILL HANDLE THE ENTRIES OF THE
      *    USER PRINTFILE MCFPCSPRNT.  THIS FILE CONTAINS
      *    THE PRINTER/SPOOLER NUMBERS DEFINED TO A USER
      *    AND DISPLAY STATION.   THESE PRINTER NUMBERS ARE
      *    RETRIEVED FOR USE IN AN APPLICATION WITH A CALL
      *    TO TSPLPRT, WHICH RETURNS 5 PRINTER NUMBERS FOR
      *    A USER AND TERMINAL, OR A USER AND GENERIC TERMINAL,
      *    OR A GENERIC USER AND TERMINAL.  PRINTERS CAN BE
      *    MAINTAINED WITH THIS PROGRAM EITHER BY USER OR BY
      *    DISPLAY STATION.  EACH GENERIC USER OR TERMINAL WILL
      *    HAVE THE NAME "GENERIC" STORED FOR ITS RECORD.  IF
      *    THE USER ENTERS A BLANK USER OR TERMINAL, THEN IT
      *    WILL BE ASSUMED THAT THEY WANT GENERIC AND THE NAME
      *    WILL BE CHANGED FROM BLANK TO "GENERIC".

004700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
004900 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
005000 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
005300
005400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
005500 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUSERPRT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRT-USER
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRT1
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT PRT-USER-TERM
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRNT
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT PRT-DSPST
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRT2
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT PRT-TERM-USER
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRT3
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT PRINTERS
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRNT
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT PRINTERS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRNT
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

005800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC          PIC X(2000).
       FD  PRT-USER
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PRT-USER-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT  OF MCFLCSPRT1.
       FD  PRT-USER-TERM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PRT-USER-TERM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT  OF MCFLCSPRNT.
       FD  PRT-DSPST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PRT-DSPST-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT  OF MCFLCSPRT2.
       FD  PRT-TERM-USER
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PRT-TERM-USER-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT  OF MCFLCSPRT3.
       FD  PRINTERS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PRINTERS-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT  OF MCFLCSPRNT.
       FD  PRINTERS-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PRINTERS-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT  OF MCFLCSPRNT.

006500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
006600************************************************************
